SOLUTION_MASTER_SPECIES

Toluene   Toluene       0     C7H8  92.13



SOLUTION_SPECIES

Toluene = Toluene

 log_k   0.0



SOLUTION 1 Influent water

 units mol/l

 temp        25.0

 pH          7.0 charge

 O(0)        2e-10

 Toluene     0.001

 Cl          0.001

 C           1e-10

 Na          0.001



SOLUTION 2 Background water

 units mol/l

 temp        25.0

 pH          7.0 charge

 O(0)        2e-3

 Toluene     1e-10

 Cl          1e-10

 C           1e-10

 Na          1e-10



END



KINETICS 1

C7H8_degradation

 -formula Toluene 1.0 C7H8 -1.0

 -m0  0.0

 -runge_kutta 6



RATES

C7H8_degradation

-start

10 Ks = 1.0d-5

15 Ks2 = 1.0d-10

20 Ka = 3.125d-6

25 Ka2 = 1.0d-10

30 qm = 1.0e-9

40 f1 = MOL("Toluene")/(Ks + MOL("Toluene"))

45 f1 = f1 * (MOL("Toluene")/(Ks2 + MOL("Toluene")))^2

50 f2 = MOL("O2")/(Ka + MOL("O2"))

55 f2 = f2*(MOL("O2")/(Ka2 + MOL("O2")))^2

60 rate = -qm * f1 * f2

70 moles = rate * TIME

80 PUT(rate, 1)

90 SAVE moles

-end



SELECTED_OUTPUT

        -file biod.sel

        -reset false

USER_PUNCH

-headings Toluene O2(aq) C reaction_increment

10 PUNCH TOT("Toluene"),  MOL("O2"), TOT("C")

20 rate = GET(1)*86400

30 rate2 = -rate

40 PUNCH rate2



END

